# Autonomous agent workflow

1. Bind work to a requirement ID (`VIZ-*` or `PLAT-P0-*`).
2. Read the matching requirement doc before editing.
3. For deterministic behavior, add/update a Vitest test first when practical.
4. After changes in `quatricmorph/`, run `npm test` and `npm run build`.
5. Report: requirement ID, files changed, test/build result, remaining checklist items.
6. Never mark platform P0 complete based only on Three.js viz work.
7. Do not download large model weights in automated flows without an allowlisted fixture policy.
